                            <section class="dics-section dics-section-light" id="integration-types">
                                <div class="dics-container">
                                    <div class="dics-centered-heading">
                                        <span class="dics-eyebrow">Integration Types</span>
                                        <h2>Every connection your stack needs.</h2>
                                        <p class="dics-section-lead">
                                            Data flows one way — automatically — with no manual re-entry,
                                            no mismatch, and a full audit trail in Odoo.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="dics-stat-grid">
                                        <article class="dics-stat-card">
                                            <h3>REST &amp; XML-RPC APIs</h3>
                                            <p>Bidirectional API integrations between Odoo and external systems —
                                                versioned, documented, and failure-safe from day one.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>
                                        <article class="dics-stat-card">
                                            <h3>Webhook Pipelines</h3>
                                            <p>Event-driven webhooks that push data instantly when something changes —
                                                no polling, no lag, no missed updates.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>
                                        <article class="dics-stat-card">
                                            <h3>eCommerce Sync</h3>
                                            <p>Real-time bidirectional sync with Shopify, WooCommerce, Amazon SP-API,
                                                and custom storefronts — orders, inventory, pricing.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>
                                        <article class="dics-stat-card">
                                            <h3>Payment Gateway</h3>
                                            <p>Stripe, Razorpay, PayTabs, and custom payment integrations with automatic
                                                ledger posting and bank reconciliation.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>
                                        <article class="dics-stat-card">
                                            <h3>Courier &amp; 3PL</h3>
                                            <p>FedEx, DHL, Aramex, and custom carrier connectors with live tracking,
                                                label generation, and fulfillment status webhooks.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>
                                        <article class="dics-stat-card">
                                            <h3>Custom Middleware</h3>
                                            <p>Purpose-built middleware layers for multi-system data transformations,
                                                routing logic, and protocol translation.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </section>

                            <section class="dics-section">
                                <div class="dics-container">
                                    <div class="dics-centered-heading">
                                        <span class="dics-eyebrow">How We Build It</span>
                                        <h2>Integrations built to run, not just demo.</h2>
                                        <p class="dics-section-lead">
                                            Every integration we ship is built for real production load —
                                            failure-safe, observable, and maintainable long after go-live.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="dics-detail-capability-grid">

                                        <article class="dics-detail-capability-card">
                                            <div class="dics-detail-card-icon">
                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">sync_alt</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3>Bidirectional by Design</h3>
                                            <p>
                                                We architect integrations so data flows correctly in both directions
                                                from the start — with conflict resolution, field mapping, and
                                                transformation rules agreed before a line of code is written.
                                                No "sync one way, figure out the other later."
                                            </p>
                                        </article>

                                        <article class="dics-detail-capability-card">
                                            <div class="dics-detail-card-icon">
                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">security</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3>Failure-Safe Pipelines</h3>
                                            <p>
                                                Retry logic, dead-letter queues, and alerting baked in from the
                                                start. A failed API call or network timeout does not silently
                                                corrupt your data — it retries, escalates, and logs. You know
                                                about the problem before your customer does.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>

                                        <article class="dics-detail-capability-card">
                                            <div class="dics-detail-card-icon">
                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">monitoring</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3>Observable &amp; Auditable</h3>
                                            <p>
                                                Every sync event, transformation, and error is logged with
                                                context and timestamp inside Odoo's chatter. No black-box
                                                middleware that only the integration vendor can debug.
                                                Your team can read the log.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>

                                        <article class="dics-detail-capability-card">
                                            <div class="dics-detail-card-icon">
                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">api</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3>Protocol Agnostic</h3>
                                            <p>
                                                REST, SOAP, XML-RPC, GraphQL, EDI, FTP, or proprietary
                                                binary formats — we've built for all of them. The choice of
                                                protocol is driven by what the external system supports,
                                                not by what we're comfortable with.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>

                                        <article class="dics-detail-capability-card">
                                            <div class="dics-detail-card-icon">
                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">hub</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3>Multi-System Orchestration</h3>
                                            <p>
                                                When a single business event needs to touch five systems —
                                                Odoo, a WMS, a courier API, a GST portal, and a CRM —
                                                we build the orchestration layer so each system gets the
                                                right data in the right format at the right time.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>

                                        <article class="dics-detail-capability-card">
                                            <div class="dics-detail-card-icon">
                                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">trending_up</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <h3>Built to Evolve</h3>
                                            <p>
                                                Integrations are structured so adding a new endpoint, changing
                                                a field mapping, or switching a payment provider does not
                                                require a full rebuild. Documented, modular, and owned by you —
                                                not locked to us.
                                            </p>
                                        </article>

                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </section>

                            <section class="dics-section dics-section-surface">
                                <div class="dics-container">
                                    <div class="dics-centered-heading">
                                        <span class="dics-eyebrow">Platforms</span>
                                        <h2>Systems we connect to Odoo.</h2>
                                        <p class="dics-section-lead">
                                            If it has an API, we can integrate it. Below is what we've built
                                            for production clients — not just prototypes.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="dics-module-grid">
                                        <article class="dics-module-card">
                                            <div class="dics-module-icon">🛒</div>
                                            <h3>eCommerce</h3>
                                            <p>Shopify, WooCommerce, Magento, Amazon SP-API, Flipkart Seller API</p>
                                        </article>
                                        <article class="dics-module-card">
                                            <div class="dics-module-icon">💳</div>
                                            <h3>Payments</h3>
                                            <p>Stripe, Razorpay, PayTabs, CCAvenue, PayU, custom PG connectors</p>
                                        </article>
                                        <article class="dics-module-card">
                                            <div class="dics-module-icon">🚚</div>
                                            <h3>Logistics</h3>
                                            <p>FedEx, DHL, Aramex, Delhivery, Bluedart, Shiprocket, custom couriers</p>
                                        </article>
                                        <article class="dics-module-card">
                                            <div class="dics-module-icon">🧾</div>
                                            <h3>Tax &amp; Compliance</h3>
                                            <p>GST Portal, IRP e-invoicing, GSTR auto-filing, TDS computation</p>
