                                        <p>
                                            Tell us what needs to connect. We'll map out
                                            exactly what the integration would take — time,
                                            complexity, and cost — no obligation.
                                        </p>
                                        <div class="dics-contact-details">
                                            <strong>Ahmedabad, Gujarat, India</strong>
                                            <a href="mailto:contact@datainteger.com">contact@datainteger.com</a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <form class="dics-contact-form">
